00:26:43,080 --> 00:26:44,960
Don't do this.

516
00:26:47,140 --> 00:26:48,697
It's my fault.

517
00:26:48,780 --> 00:26:52,400
I'm the one who screwed up. Okay.

518
00:27:00,200 --> 00:27:02,560
Please don't forget your promise.

519
00:27:03,480 --> 00:27:07,951
Like I said, you can't defy the celestial
dragons even if they kill someone!

520
00:27:10,120 --> 00:27:13,000
There was a time when I was a pirate.

521
00:27:13,320 --> 00:27:14,280
A criminal!

522
00:27:15,240 --> 00:27:20,200
This is the punishment I deserve for
doing all of those horrible things.

523
00:27:23,960 --> 00:27:25,320
I'm so sorry.

524
00:27:26,220 --> 00:27:29,700
I didn't mean for everything
to turn out like this.

525
00:27:32,720 --> 00:27:38,480
I just wanted to make amends
with Nami however I could.

526
00:27:40,820 --> 00:27:45,080
Even if it wasn't much, I wanted
to be helpful to you and your crew.

527
00:27:47,860 --> 00:27:52,220
But I screwed that up, I guess,
just like every other time.

528
00:27:53,760 --> 00:27:56,897
I wanted to do something right for

529
00:27:56,980 --> 00:28:01,620
once and show Nami how sorry I am.

530
00:28:05,180 --> 00:28:08,880
All my life, all I've ever
done is cause trouble.

531
00:28:11,200 --> 00:28:12,340
I'm sorry.

532
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:14,540
Forgive me.

533
00:28:16,900 --> 00:28:17,900
That's enough.

534
00:28:18,220 --> 00:28:22,200
Stop all that annoying babbling
fish before I shut you up for good.

535
00:28:25,700 --> 00:28:28,740
Oh, how dare you don't
look at me like that.

536
00:28:35,680 --> 00:28:36,510
Don't!

537
00:28:36,593 --> 00:28:37,640
Straw Hat, please!

538
00:28:39,940 --> 00:28:42,411
You're going to get in really big trouble!

539
00:28:42,800 --> 00:28:44,160
Don't do it!

540
00:28:46,520 --> 00:28:47,350
Easy.

541
00:28:47,520 --> 00:28:48,400
You see this?

542
00:28:53,100 --> 00:28:55,840
What is that man doing? He's crazy.

543
00:28:56,380 --> 00:28:57,620
Straw Hat Luffy.

544
00:28:58,280 --> 00:28:59,380
He's serious.

545
00:29:02,560 --> 00:29:04,400
Now you're annoying me too!
